        "title": "We may consider use the indefinite pronouns for the following scenarios; though, it does not mean they cannot appear in other different contexts.",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "We may consider use the indefinite pronouns for the following scenarios; though, it does not mean they cannot appear in other different contexts.",
          "Scenarios Examples 1 Generalization Everybody failed the test. 2 Being Indefinite Do you want to go somewhere? 3 Being Secretive - Who called? - Someone did (laughs).",
          "To consider Indefinite pronouns can be used in any tense."
        ],
